s}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (equinumerosity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardopCardinalSum}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardopCardinalSum}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}sum} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardopCardinalSum}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\!\\left(\\lambda,(\\kappa\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\mu\\times\\{1\\})\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}sum} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardopCardinalSum}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\!\\left(\\lambda,(\\kappa\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\mu\\times\\{1\\})\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tagged copies make the two summands disjoint, and the registered equinumerosity predicate states that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> is their cardinal sum; the unrelated submodule-sum dependency is not used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1",